<p><strong>A Type of parrot:</strong></p>
<p>Diet consists of fern fronds, various parts of a tree and <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">7</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="7" name="question_7" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[7] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span></p>
<p>Nests are created in <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">8</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="8" name="question_8" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[8] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> . where eggs are laid.</p>
<p><strong>Arrival of Polynesian settlers</strong></p>
<p>The <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">9</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="9" name="question_9" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[9] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span> of the kakapo were used to make clothes.</p>
