<p><span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">11</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="11" name="question_11" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[11] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span></p>
<p>The Recovery Plan included an increase in <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">12</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="12" name="question_12" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[12] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span></p>
<p>A current goal of the Recovery Plan is to maintain the involvement of <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-input-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">13</strong><input type="text" data-qnum="13" name="question_13" class="ielts-inline-input" placeholder="[13] javob..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></span></span><strong> </strong>in kakapo protection.</p>
